        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define weights, standard deviations, and correlation\n    weight_1 = 0.40\n    weight_2 = 0.60\n    std_dev_1 = 0.30\n    std_dev_2 = 0.15\n    correlation = 0.25\n\n    # Calculate portfolio standard deviation\n    variance = (\n        (weight_1 * std_dev_1) ** 2\n        + (weight_2 * std_dev_2) ** 2\n        + 2 * weight_1 * weight_2 * std_dev_1 * std_dev_2 * correlation\n    )\n    portfolio_std_dev_percent = variance ** 0.5 * 100\n\n    # Return the answer to three decimal places\n    return round(portfolio_std_dev_percent, 3)\n```",
